id: pm-stdin-schema-fields
title: Full-item stdin JSON must preserve declared schema and extension custom fields
description: "Disposable acceptance on 2026.10.9 confirms a declared schema string escape_class works through --escape-class but create --stdin-json converts it into --field key=escape_class,value=production_defect and refuses extension_item_field_unknown with provided_fields=[key]. Full-item JSON cannot represent project-defined schema fields despite accepting arbitrary metadata keys. Inspect schema-field versus registered-extension ownership before adapting custom values; retain typed refusal and typo guidance."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-09T11:20:17.021Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-09T11:52:53.835Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: Create and get-to-update stdin JSON round trips preserve declared string/number/boolean/object/array schema and extension fields; explicit flags retain precedence; undeclared fields and typos refuse before mutation; disposable CLI and public SDK tests prove exact item/history behavior.
parent: pm-mpbb
risk: medium
confidence: high
expected_result: Full-item JSON can represent declared project schema and extension fields with precise typed validation and explicit-flag precedence.
